{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3695/lemmadeck/.tmp/resume182-6-8a-n10-figure-context3695-FIRST/artifacts/8a/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg8-c2-s2-n10/lesson.json","sha256":"d13354560d681bb189cd3ed1310e1abebdde6bf5b517bf0cf981405090a8d676","content":{"id":"alg8-c2-s2-n10","card_id":"alg8-c2-s2-n10","chapter":"第二章　二元方程和二元不等式","section":"§4. 二元不等式和二元不等式组","number":"10","title":"二元不等式组","printed_title":"10. 二元不等式组","start_page":60,"start_printed":53,"figures":[{"id":"fig-22","label":"图 22","page":60},{"id":"fig-23","label":"图 23","page":61},{"id":"fig-24","label":"图 24","page":61},{"id":"fig-25","label":"图 25","page":63}],"exercise_count":7,"prose":[{"kind":"p","text":"我们来讨论二元不等式组：\n$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant x,\\\\x^2+y^2&\\leqslant9.\\end{aligned}\\right.$","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#2"],"source_text":"我们来讨论二元不等式组：$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant x,\\\\x^2+y^2&\\leqslant9.\\end{aligned}\\right.$","changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]},{"kind":"p","text":"这个不等式组的解集合是其中各不等式的解集合的交集。","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#3"],"source_text":"这个不等式组的解集合是其中各不等式的解集合的交集.","changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]},{"kind":"p","text":"我们来看看，以所讨论的不等式组的解为坐标的平面上点的集合是什么。","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#4"],"source_text":"我们来看看，以所讨论的不等式组的解为坐标的平面上点的集合是什么.","changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]},{"kind":"p","text":"坐标满足不等式$y\\geqslant x$的点的集合，是直线$y=x$上的点的集合与这条直线上方的开半平面上的点的集合的并集（图22中用水平细线表示）。\n坐标满足不等式$x^2+y^2\\leqslant9$的点的集合，是圆心在坐标原点、半径为3的圆形区域，包含内部和边界（图22中用铅直细线表示）。\n\n一个点的坐标满足这个不等式组，当且仅当这个点属于这两个点集的交集。\n图22中，两种细线重叠的区域就是这两个点集的交集。\n这就是说，所讨论的不等式组给出一个包含内部和边界的半圆形区域。","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#5","p0060#8"],"source_text":"坐标满足不等式$y\\geqslant x$的点的集合，是直线$y=x$上和位于这条直线上方的开半平面上点的集合的并集（在图22中，这个集合画水平的细线表示）. 坐标满足不等式$x^2+y^2\\leqslant9$的点的集合是圆心在坐标原点、半径为3的圆（在图22中，这个集合画铅直的细线表示）. 显然，属于由不等式组中每个不等式给出的点的集合的交集的这些点的坐标，并且只有这些点的坐标，才能满足不等式组（在图22中，和这个交集对应的是一种细线条画在另一种细线条上面的区域）. 这就是说，所讨论的不等式组给出半圆.","changes":["layout","clarification"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]},{"kind":"fig","text":"","id":"fig-22","label":"图 22","printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#6"],"source_text":"","changes":[],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]},{"kind":"cap","text":"图 22","id":null,"label":"图 22","printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#7"],"source_text":"图 22","changes":[],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]},{"kind":"p","text":"我们再举两个例子。","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#9"],"source_text":"我们再举两个例子.","changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]},{"kind":"p","text":"例1：考察不等式组：\n$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x&\\leqslant0,\\\\y&\\geqslant0\\end{aligned}\\right.$\n它给出第二象限及其在坐标轴上的边界，包含坐标原点（图23）。","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#10","p0061#1"],"source_text":"例1 不等式组$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x&\\leqslant0,\\\\y&\\geqslant0\\end{aligned}\\right.$给出第二象限（图23）.","changes":["layout","clarification"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]},{"kind":"fig","text":"","id":"fig-23","label":"图 23","printed_page":54,"source_refs":["p0061#2"],"source_text":"","changes":[],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]},{"kind":"cap","text":"图 23","id":null,"label":"图 23","printed_page":54,"source_refs":["p0061#3"],"source_text":"图 23","changes":[],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]},{"kind":"fig","text":"","id":"fig-24","label":"图 24","printed_page":54,"source_refs":["p0061#4"],"source_text":"","changes":[],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]},{"kind":"cap","text":"图 24","id":null,"label":"图 24","printed_page":54,"source_refs":["p0061#5"],"source_text":"图 24","changes":[],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]},{"kind":"p","text":"例2：考察不等式组：\n$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant2x-3,\\\\y&\\leqslant2x+2\\end{aligned}\\right.$\n它给出以直线$y=2x-3$和$y=2x+2$为边界的带形区域，包含两条边界直线（图24）。","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":54,"source_refs":["p0061#6"],"source_text":"例2 不等式组$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant2x-3,\\\\y&\\leqslant2x+2\\end{aligned}\\right.$给出由直线$y=2x-3$和$y=2x+2$为边界的带（图24）.","changes":["layout","clarification"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}],"schema":"ld-s10y-lesson/edition-lesson@1","edition":"modern-us-neutral","status":"draft","source":{"path":"lessons/alg8-c2-s2-n10/lesson.json","sha256":"8be6afcb95fbdbc9df16eb2113ea4ff8e6aac55228fdb2a45ef3e816c7190770","data":{"id":"alg8-c2-s2-n10","card_id":"alg8-c2-s2-n10","chapter":"第二章　二元方程和二元不等式","section":"§4. 二元不等式和二元不等式组","number":"10","title":"二元不等式组","printed_title":"10. 二元不等式组","start_page":60,"start_printed":53,"figures":[{"id":"fig-22","label":"图 22","page":60},{"id":"fig-23","label":"图 23","page":61},{"id":"fig-24","label":"图 24","page":61},{"id":"fig-25","label":"图 25","page":63}],"exercise_count":7,"prose":[{"kind":"p","text":"我们来讨论二元不等式组：$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant x,\\\\x^2+y^2&\\leqslant9.\\end{aligned}\\right.$","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#2"]},{"kind":"p","text":"这个不等式组的解集合是其中各不等式的解集合的交集.","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#3"]},{"kind":"p","text":"我们来看看，以所讨论的不等式组的解为坐标的平面上点的集合是什么.","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#4"]},{"kind":"p","text":"坐标满足不等式$y\\geqslant x$的点的集合，是直线$y=x$上和位于这条直线上方的开半平面上点的集合的并集（在图22中，这个集合画水平的细线表示）. 坐标满足不等式$x^2+y^2\\leqslant9$的点的集合是圆心在坐标原点、半径为3的圆（在图22中，这个集合画铅直的细线表示）. 显然，属于由不等式组中每个不等式给出的点的集合的交集的这些点的坐标，并且只有这些点的坐标，才能满足不等式组（在图22中，和这个交集对应的是一种细线条画在另一种细线条上面的区域）. 这就是说，所讨论的不等式组给出半圆.","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#5","p0060#8"]},{"kind":"fig","text":"","id":"fig-22","label":"图 22","printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#6"]},{"kind":"cap","text":"图 22","id":null,"label":"图 22","printed_page":53,"source_refs":["p0060#7"]},{"kind":"p","text":"